I follow Priya into the kitchen.
I ask her, "Priya, shall I help?"
She gives me some plates.
She says, "Maya, let's set the dining table first."
Then we go to the dining table.
She brings spoons and water glasses.
We arrange everything properly.
While working, we make casual conversation.
She asks about my work.
I say, "On Monday I will write new code."
Priya laughs.
She says, "Let's not talk about work today."
"Today we will only eat delicious food."
We place the water glasses near the plates.
Everything feels very relaxed.
I think that this evening will be very wonderful.
